From 1730f213947333b91bf9e57a1b12cd56bd8edbe3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stew Forster <stew675@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 21:01:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] WIP HC16: native-BF16 producers for the HC/attention
 activations + non-temporal accesses

Squashed theme commit (7 originals): native-BF16 producers for the HC gate and
the normalized stream; for the remaining HC/attention activations; the dead-F32-
store skip when every consumer reads the BF16 copy; the xn stream BF16-only; and
the non-temporal accesses -- dsv4_hc pre/post, non-temporal LOADS in
concat_transposed_src1_dim0 + moe_weighted_reduction, and the fused gated-unary
producer (+ the ggml_cuda_nt_load helper).
---
